<title>GERMANY: Commerzbank new head of equities to start Monday.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank new head of equities to start Monday.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG said on Friday that Memet Dalman, who quit Deutsche Morgan Grenfell in Tokyo, will start work on Monday as head of Commerzbank's global equities business.</p>
<p>A Commerzbank spokesman denied reports in British newspapers that the bank plans to invest an annual 200 million pounds in its global investment banking business.</p>
<p>The spokesman also said the level of investment in Commerzbank's global equities business had not been decided yet.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
